WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,800
This prodigal son actually has such a heart

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:05,850
It's really beyond my expectation

3
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:09,290
I want to see this prodigal Wang Bao again

4
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:10,810
Call the prince

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,290
Will you go out with me?

6
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:16,940
Your Majesty’s smile is even scarier than the previous one.

7
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:29,040
You can go at this speed

8
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,040
As expected of the former Duke’s son

9
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:34,280
But that northern barbarian has also been released and imprisoned.

10
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,040
It didn't say anything about letting that barbarian go.

11
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:43,500
Then I can rest assured, sir.

12
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:47,440
Let's just assume it's okay.

13
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,240
I was invited here
